{
 "description": "Requires a ChainHelix API key as bearer token, or 2 cents per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. MEV event rates per chain and type vs the trailing weekly pace. window in hours, default 24, max 168. Types overlap and must not be summed: a backrun transaction also emits an arbitrage row. NFT coverage is ERC-721 only, so nft_mev excludes all ERC-1155 activity. Chains covered: ethereum, bnb, avalanche, polygon.",
